# Rust build artifacts — regenerate with `cargo build`. NEVER commit these.
/target
**/target

# rustfmt backups + MSVC debug symbols
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# coverage / profiling output (cargo test -C instrument-coverage, etc.)
*.profraw
*.profdata

# Generated wasm-bindgen output. Rebuild it with `scripts/build.sh` or
# `scripts/build-wasm.sh`; published Rust crates never include these directories.
crates/wasm/pkg-node
crates/wasm/pkg-web
crates/wasm/pkg-web-threads
crates/wasm/pkg-bundler
crates/prover/pkg-node
crates/prover/pkg-web
crates/prover/pkg-web-threads
crates/prover/pkg-bundler

# Assembled npm package (scripts/build-npm.mjs) and its tarball. Rebuild it
# from the wasm-bindgen output; CI publishes it from a tagged release.
/dist
*.tgz

# Local JavaScript tooling.
node_modules

# macOS / IDE metadata.
.DS_Store
.idea

# NOT ignored (deliberately tracked — do not add here):
#   Cargo.lock                pinned dependency graph + checksums (supply-chain gate)
#   crates/*/testdata/*.json  committed golden vectors (parity oracles)
